 - regarding the #Metrics# and the #Window#:
    #Metrics# gather information about the total working time
    #Window# gathers infos about 60s price, volume and volatility changes

 - #volatility#: here we take the #volatility of returns#
    i.e. ri = (P(i) - P(i-1))/P(i-1) - % change of the investment.
    volatility is calculated over the sqrt(variance of returns)

 - #metrics# as monitor: in order to prevent race condition we synchronize all threads with #metrics# as shared monitor